Shannon Soul is the dwarven bartender at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|The Crowded Flea]]. He was born and raised in the neighborhood and is close to sixty years old. A short bench behind the bar lets him stand at eye level with the stools at the front.

He keeps a few Raylish spirits on the top shelf, including a brand of Raelish gin, and sells them dear because no more is coming from [[Geography/Raelion/index|Raelion]].
